id: demonic-battle-strike
name: Demonic Battle
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# Demonic Battle (4)'s, open beside an Opponent suffering a Combat Condition - that Opponent the target, the table's to keep.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  If you are adjacent to an Opponent suffering from a Combat Condition, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: If you are adjacent to an Opponent suffering from a Combat Condition, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver. If you do, you must target that Opponent with that Attacking Maneuver.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A (the Basic Attack's)
  –Effect: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver at that Opponent.

---

[on used]
maneuverOutOfSequence(basic-attack);
